Where monsters go to get away from it all.

2
00:08:16,363 --> 00:08:22,363
Hotel Transylvania is a animation, comedy, family
film directed by Genndy Tartakovsky.

3
00:12:24,545 --> 00:12:30,545
Welcome to Hotel Transylvania, Dracula's lavish five-stake resort, where
monsters and their families can live it up and no humans are allowed.

4
